  "historyNote": "#5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12346, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14524, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
